<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Mount Athos 1 - 140,000 tonnes coal Puerto Prodeco/Rotterdam $6 fio 20,000 shinc/40,000 shinc 6-16/5 Dieulemar.</p>
<p>Buenavista - 40,000 tonnes coke Xingang/Sepetiba $12 fio 8-17/5 Glencore.</p>
<p>ORE - Cape Kestrel - 125,000 tonnes ore Seven Islands/Port Kembla $10.65 fio 5-20/5 BHP.</p>
<p>TBN - 57,000 tonnes bauxite Port Kamsar/Aughinish $5.50 fio 1-8/5 Interbulk.</p>
</text>
